13:23.080 --> 13:23.870
Jangan!

13:24.270 --> 13:25.080
Sadarlah!

13:27.000 --> 13:27.750
Xuanye!

14:38.360 --> 14:39.030
Ayo maju!

15:42.440 --> 15:43.270
Di mana dia?

16:34.750 --> 16:35.270
Li.

16:36.340 --> 16:37.030
Li.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.270
Ayo ikut aku.

16:46.360 --> 16:46.960
Xuanye.

16:48.030 --> 16:48.750
Bebaskan aku.

16:49.600 --> 16:50.480
Bebaskan aku.

16:51.270 --> 16:52.510
Aku akan membunuhmu!

16:52.630 --> 16:53.600
